{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】警方今日(10月23日)為已故警員朱振國舉行最高榮譽喪禮，將會安葬浩園。同日，屯門醫院神經醫學中心開幕，推動跨專科治療腦神經疾病，醫務衞生局局長盧寵茂將出席儀式。</p><p>採訪日誌｜已故警員朱振國舉行最高榮譽喪禮／屯門醫院神經醫學中心開幕</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:59:40.141490+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:24:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:58:04.973268+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:58:04.973268+00:00","content_hash":"bf8a378e76783c8ccb164f87efb233856307334a4fe4dacff59191ead140c625","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}